#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:4
msgid "KVM - 虚拟化解决方案"
msgstr "KVM - Virtualization Solution"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:9
msgid "KVM（Kernel-based Virtual Machine 基于内核的虚拟机) 是具备Intel VT或 AMD-V功能的 x86 平台全虚拟化解决方案，它包含一个为处理器提供底层虚拟化可加载的核心模块kvm.ko (kvm-intel.ko或kvm-AMD.ko)。仅有KVM模块是远远不够的， KVM内核模块本身只能提供CPU和内存的虚拟化，用户无法直接控制内核模块去作事情，KVM还需要一个经过修改的 :doc:`qemu` 软件作为虚拟机上层控制，才能构成一个完成的虚拟化技术。 :doc:`qemu` 也是一个虚拟化软件。它的特点是可虚拟不同的CPU。比如说在x86的CPU上可虚拟一个Power的CPU，并可利用它编译出可运行在Power上的程序。"
msgstr "KVM (Kernel-based Virtual Machine) is a full virtualization solution for x86 platforms that have Intel VT or AMD-V support. It includes a loadable core kernel module, kvm.ko (kvm-intel.ko or kvm-AMD.ko), that provides low-level virtualization for the processor. The KVM module alone is far from enough — the KVM kernel module by itself can only virtualize CPU and memory, and users can't directly control the kernel module to do things. KVM also needs a modified copy of :doc:`qemu` as the upper-level control software for the virtual machine, in order to form a complete virtualization solution. :doc:`qemu` is itself also a virtualization program. Its distinguishing feature is that it can virtualize different CPUs — for example, on an x86 CPU it can virtualize a Power CPU, and can be used to compile programs that run on Power."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:18
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:20
msgid ":literal:`apt-get install qemu-kvm libvirt-bin`  [#]_"
msgstr ":literal:`apt-get install qemu-kvm libvirt-bin`  [#]_"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:22
msgid "KVM 使用了 QEMU 的基于 x86 的部分，并稍加改造，形成可控制 KVM 内核模块的用户空间工具 QEMU-KVM。 [#]_ QEMU-KVM 通过ioctl调用/dev/kvm接口，将有关CPU指令的部分交由内核模块来做。KVM 实现了cpu和内存的虚拟化，qemu模拟IO设备。"
msgstr "KVM uses, with slight modification, the x86-based portion of QEMU, forming the userspace tool QEMU-KVM that controls the KVM kernel module. [#]_ QEMU-KVM calls the /dev/kvm interface via ioctl, handing the CPU-instruction-related parts off to the kernel module. KVM implements CPU and memory virtualization, while qemu emulates I/O devices."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:27
msgid "QEMU-KVM 工具效率不高，不易于使用，RedHat 为 KVM 开发了更多的辅助工具，比如 :doc:`libvirt`"
msgstr "The QEMU-KVM tool isn't very efficient and isn't easy to use, so RedHat developed more auxiliary tools for KVM, such as :doc:`libvirt`"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:30
msgid ":doc:`libvirt` 是一套提供了多种语言接口的 API，为各种虚拟化工具提供一套方便、可靠的编程接口，不仅支持 KVM，而且支持 Xen 等其他虚拟机，而且一些常用的虚拟机管理工具（如 :doc:`virsh` 、 :doc:`virt-install` 、virt-manager等）和云计算框架平台（如OpenStack、OpenNebula、Eucalyptus等）都在底层使用libvirt的应用程序接口。"
msgstr ":doc:`libvirt` is a set of APIs offering interfaces in multiple languages, providing a convenient and reliable programming interface for various virtualization tools. It supports not only KVM but also other virtual machines such as Xen, and several commonly-used VM management tools (such as :doc:`virsh`, :doc:`virt-install`, virt-manager, etc.) and cloud computing framework platforms (such as OpenStack, OpenNebula, Eucalyptus, etc.) all use libvirt's application programming interface under the hood."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:33
msgid "为了方便管理虚拟机，应该把当前的操作用户加入 kvm 与 libvirt 组。这样就可以使用 virsh 命令了。"
msgstr "To make managing virtual machines easier, you should add the current operating user to the kvm and libvirt groups. This lets you use the virsh command."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:37
msgid "使用"
msgstr "Usage"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:40
msgid "设置桥接网络"
msgstr "Setting up bridged networking"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:42
msgid "默认情况下，:doc:`qemu` 会给 客户机提供 NAT 网络，这种情况下主机和客户机访问不到对方。为了给客户机提供完整的网络访问权限，应该创建网桥。 [#]_"
msgstr "By default, :doc:`qemu` provides the guest with a NAT network, in which case the host and guest cannot reach each other. To give the guest full network access, you should create a bridge. [#]_"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:45
msgid ":literal:`apt-get install bridge-utils`"
msgstr ":literal:`apt-get install bridge-utils`"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:47
msgid "修改 /etc/network/interfaces文件，让网桥br0代理eth0。配置完成后，在客户机中使用网桥接口。"
msgstr "Modify the /etc/network/interfaces file so that bridge br0 proxies eth0. Once configured, use the bridge interface within the guest."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:66
msgid "创建新的主机"
msgstr "Creating a new guest"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:68
msgid "virtinst 提供命令行 :doc:`virt-install` 来创建虚拟机。"
msgstr "virtinst provides the :doc:`virt-install` command line for creating virtual machines."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:70
msgid ":literal:`apt-get install virtinst`"
msgstr ":literal:`apt-get install virtinst`"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:87
msgid "创建成功后使用 :doc:`virsh` -c qemu:///system list --all 查看虚拟机状态，running 状态表示创建启动成功，使用 VNC 客户端连接服务器即可完成安装。"
msgstr "After successful creation, use :doc:`virsh` -c qemu:///system list --all to check the VM status; a status of running means creation and startup succeeded, and you can complete the installation by connecting to the server with a VNC client."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:91
msgid "如果需要预置自动安装请参考 preseed [#]_ ."
msgstr "If you need unattended preseeded installation, refer to preseed [#]_ ."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:94
msgid "启动与停止"
msgstr "Starting and stopping"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:96
msgid "在登录常规用户的情况下 :doc:`libvirt` 默认情况会使用 qemu:///session 域，添加 -c qemu:///system 选项可使用 qemu:///system 域。"
msgstr "When logged in as a regular user, :doc:`libvirt` uses the qemu:///session domain by default; add the -c qemu:///system option to use the qemu:///system domain instead."

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:100
msgid "查看客户机列表"
msgstr "List guests"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:102
msgid ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system list --all`"
msgstr ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system list --all`"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:104
msgid "停止一个客户机"
msgstr "Stop a guest"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:106
msgid ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system shutdown demo`"
msgstr ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system shutdown demo`"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:108
msgid "如果停止失败，可以强制停止"
msgstr "If stopping fails, you can force-stop it"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:110
msgid ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system destroy demo`"
msgstr ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system destroy demo`"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:112
msgid "启动客户机"
msgstr "Start a guest"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:114
msgid ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system start demo`"
msgstr ":literal:`virsh -c qemu:///system start demo`"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:116
msgid "设置虚拟机开机启动"
msgstr "Set a VM to autostart on boot"

#: ../../linux/kvm.rst:118
msgid ":literal:`virsh autostart alice`"
msgstr ":literal:`virsh autostart alice`"

